  "description": "Major solid-state battery development and weekly market recap with BUYS",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday! I hope you are enjoying your day off from the markets. I am cognizant some of you degenerates are itching for the market to open…but enjoy the down time!</p><p>Very quick update on Quantum Scape…the worst position in my portfolio at -33%…. BUT IM NOT SELLING. I think Quantum Scape has significant upside ahead of it, especially with the Honda partnership announcement. Watch the video for more explanation, its why make them. </p><p>A quick weekly wrap up in case you missed any of these posts:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocks-to-buyand-not-buy\">Winning Stock I am ADDING To</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/bull-market-resumes-and-space-x-thoughts\">Space X Thoughts &amp; My Favorite Stocks in Finance</a></p></li></ul><p>Also…going to toot my horn 📯 for a second… many were worried about the greatest investor of all time, Mark Minervini, shorting the market back on June 10th. I said not to worry about him in <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/greatest-investor-of-all-time-is\">this post</a>… and that the market would <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-276459476?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">reverse upwards violently</a>. Well, on Monday, June 15th, the S&amp;P 500 gapped up, something we do not see very often, then proceeded to making an all time high. This indicates Mark was likely stopped out of his short position. I have a lot of respect for Mark’s style of trading and always recommend his books. But I turned down the job offer from his team for a reason. </p><p>As always if you have questions, feel free to tag me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d7312c75-2778-49bd-9b8e-ccab72528629\">Main Chat</a>, during market hours. I am always available during those hours, but not after…because you need to disconnect and recharge…and so do I! </p><p>Have a great weekend! Please like ❤️ and re-stack this post… then LOG OFF! </p><p>See you Monday 👍 </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-next-ev-breakthrough-is-happening?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-next-ev-breakthrough-is-happening?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
